        "title": "Alung rianra gan khou",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Alung rianra gan khou poubaumei,",
            "Sam guango alung khou;",
            "Rianramei nanun guai nthaknga bammei tei,",
            "Din lou o karam thuan,",
            "Lung rianramei khou ai bam san khou hei.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Kahim daimei lu tei,",
            "Ai #@8 thuan ngam thui mak;",
            "Kauh sianmui khuan gaimei,",
            "Thuankumei sianmui khuan gaimei akhang.",
            "",
            "2. Kandih rianramei ram khou lung rianra,",
            "Kapma jangsi bam sini;",
            "Theimei dui kanpat khou apu #@8 njianmei,",
            "He ata chang riu ni,",
            "Rianramei mikdui keimei nai lak khe.",
            "",
            "3. Ai khou hei ntam dat nimei lat,",
            "Sa lak khe kabam thui khou;",
            "Namthan gai khou laujiuna #@8 tingsang ganbam,",
            "Nthanmei Seraphim guai,",
            "Thuankumei hei kim dat jat pulak khe.",
            "",
            "4. Hei khou tei tangkhang tingmik kathui,",
            "Kandih rianramei #@8 kham;",
            "Ai nkhuan ngam makge namthan gaimei tei hei,",
            "Guloumei guai khuan na,",
            "He Salem than hou khang khuan ngam makge."
          ]
        }
      }
